  "reason": "Inspected FSB comparisons, both obliques, neutral and grazing. Consistent non-mipmapped sampling, conservative depth support and source-appropriate de-light remove the severe stripes. Every owned albedo texel stays within actual source/continuation RGB bounds. Independent PBR channels are active again. Front/side Tier-1 pass (maximum color deltas 5.3/6.3); back fails at 21.9. Reject for remaining back teal continuation blocks and physical hair covering the side face. Refine the upstream SDF opening using observed side-face polygon corners while preserving the front hairline, and use each view's observed dominant surface color for inferred continuation. The contradictory long-back/short-front-side hair evidence remains explicit; no third independent axis or unobserved geometry truth is claimed.",
